    "prompt": "Create a function named convert_to_int that repeatedly prompts the user for input from the standard input stream and attempts to convert each input to an integer using appropriate error handling mechanisms. Continue this process in a loop until the input ends or another stopping condition is met, ensuring the function name convert_to_int is used. The function should read multiple inputs from standard input, one per line, and each individual line should be treated as a single conversion attempt. On successful conversion, continue processing subsequent input. On conversion error, handle it gracefully (using the language's exception handling or error checking idioms) and continue prompting. Return or output the successfully converted integers and error messages for failed conversions.",
